As an AI & Automation Development Intern, you will support the development of innovative digital solutions that improve procurement processes and operational efficiency. Working closely with purchasing engineering teams and business stakeholders, you will contribute to automation initiatives, AI-powered applications and process improvement projects within an international environment.
 Your contribution to something bigger: 
 Develop automation solutions and applications to support procurement and business processes;
 Collaborate with stakeholders to identify opportunities for process improvement through AI and automation technologies;
 Support the development and testing of Generative AI and intelligent workflow solutions;
 Analyze business requirements and translate them into practical digital solutions;
 Monitor emerging AI technologies and contribute with new ideas and innovative approaches.
What distinguishes you: 
 Bachelor's or Master's degree student in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Electrical Engineering or a related field;
 Academic or personal projects in software development, automation or AI are a plus;
 Knowledge of Python and software development; familiarity with AI, automation tools or LLMs is valued;
 Fluent written and spoken English required;
 Analytical, structured and able to work independently;
 Curious, proactive, collaborative and solution-oriented.
